sion of king viserys who  is played by patty considine who gave  the character a tragic majesty that my  book viserys never quite achieved i want  to say kudos to patty ryan and his  writers and miguel and the other  directors there are a lot of great  performances in house of the dragon or  hot d as i hear some are calling it you  may never have heard of some of our  actors but i think you will learn to  love them just as you did with the cast  of game of thrones now this sounds like  some very great news not only has he  seen basically every episode but the  author himself is saying everything  looks great and not only the acting and  directing but the writing as well now we  never know how things will unfold in the  future but as of right now george r  martin is on record saying how so the  dragon's first season is his story that  is very exciting he actually even said  something i just said so myself in my  last video  fire and blood is very different from  his other novels and a song of ice and  fire given the fact that there are three  different versions of nearly every major  event during the dance of the dragons  now because of this ryan and the other  writers will have to decide on which  version they will want to focus on and  according to the author he said ryan and  house of the dragon's other writers did  make some good decisions and even in  some areas they made some upgrades to  what was written in fire and blood i  also agree with what he said at the very  end of the update now i'll be the first  to say i'm not very familiar with a lot  of the actors we will see in house of  the dragon i have only seen a few of  them in some other things but i went  into game of thrones the same way there  were only a few of the actors from game  of thrones who i was familiar with  already but i ended up falling in love  with nearly every single one of them  now if you're a fan of hbo and all of  their other shows then you already know  they are the best at finding a